  "description": "YITAMOTOR floor mats are made with high-density TPE material, using advanced 3D laser technology, which not only provides a superb feel and extreme wear resistance but also offers a precise fit to your vehicle floor.\nFitment\n2024-2026 Chevy Traverse 7 Seats(Not for 24 Limited)\nFeatures\nCustom Fit: These floor mats are compatible with 2024 2025 2026 Chevrolet Traverse; 3D laser scanning technology provides full protection for the first, second, and third rows, trunk, and seat backs\nEco-Safe Certification: Our floor mats fit for 2024 2025 2026 Chevy Traverse 7 passengers (Not fit for 2024 Limited) are recyclable and durable, approved by GRS, SGS, and IATF; Eco-safe material withstands the rigor of daily abuse, offering great performance in both arctic cold and tropical floor mats 7 passengers\nAll-Season Protection & Non-Slip: With unique channels and raised edges, floor mats effectively trap liquids, snow, and sand to keep your car and shoes clean; The hooks provide anti-slip stability even in wet conditions\nEasy To Clean: Floor mats and cargo mat feature a textured, skid-resistant surface that is easy to clean; Neither cumbersome vacuum cleaners nor harsh chemicals are needed; Simply shake them out or spray them down with a hose\nWhy Choose YITAMOTOR: Our floor mats and backrest mat, trunk mat are crafted with advanced technology, rendering tailored protection and all-weather guard for your vehicle",
